{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_43_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_43","textTraditional":"一、十有四年，春，齊人、陳人、曹人伐宋。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_43_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_43","textTraditional":"二、夏，單伯會伐宋。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_43_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_43","textTraditional":"其言會伐宋何？後會也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_43_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_43","textTraditional":"三、秋七月，荊入蔡。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_43_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_43","textTraditional":"四、冬，單伯會齊侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯于鄄。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}